  "description": "The late Joseon period, when culture and art flourished brilliantly. Behind the king's reforms stood a man who protected the king with a single sword. And there was a boy who wanted to protect that man. Heo Min-Jun, the man who had to live by the king's sword. Yoon Se-Ha, the boy who loved him. The poignant chronicle of their love.\n\n *“I cherish you.”*\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
